OL,3,GNEWSAInclusive classes life changing,
OL,4,Ayoung dancers say
OL,5,
OL,6,FYoungsters in Kent have described their
OL,7,Faccessible dance classes as life
OL,8,Fchanging.
OL,10,FThis Is Us, a not-for-profit company
OL,11,Fbased in Tunbridge Wells and supported
OL,12,Fby BBC Children in Need, has been
OL,13,Foffering creative movement sessions
OL,14,Fsince 2016.
OL,16,FRobert, 10, who is autistic and has
OL,17,FADHD (attention deficit hyperactivity
OL,18,Fdisorder), said the regular classes
OL,19,F"help calm my brain" and "regulate my
OL,20,Fthoughts".
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
