OL,3,GNEWSAInclusive classes life changing,
OL,4,Ayoung dancers say
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis father Barney told the BBC: "For
OL,7,Fhim to have an opportunity to express
OL,8,Fhimself like this and to show that
OL,9,Fcreativity, how great his mind is, is a
OL,10,Freally wonderful thing. He's
OL,11,Fbrilliant."
